$ fq -h mosaic
mosaic: MOSAIC (MOdular Storage of Archived and Indexed Contents) decoder

Decode examples
===============

  # Decode file as mosaic
  $ fq -d mosaic . file
  # Decode value as mosaic
  ... | mosaic

